    "descriptionModule": {
      "briefSummary": "The purpose of this study is to measure the change in high-sensitivity C-reactive protein (hsCRP), a marker of inflammation in the body, with clazakizumab compared with placebo in adults who have elevated hsCRP and at increased risk for cardiovascular event.\n\nParticipation in the study will last about 9 months."
    },
